      "message": "The phase-1 isolate gets the default configuration, so transformers run uncapped. For `eval` and the REPL, it should take the host isolate\u0027s limits, or at least `max_symbols` and `max_syntaxes`, so that untrusted code can\u0027t intern past the cap by doing it in a `let-syntax` transformer.",
